    <string name="paywall_faq_title">FAQ’s</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_q1">What do I get with MeraTune?</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_a1">Membership mein aap apne naam wali personalised ringtones bana sakte hain, family ke liye tunes set kar sakte hain aur call aane par screen par photo laga sakte hain. Har mahine nayi tunes bhi judti rehti hain.</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_q2">How does the ₹%1$s trial work?</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_a2">Aaj sirf ₹%1$s dekar membership shuru karein. Payment ke waqt aapke UPI app mein Autopay set hota hai, aur agle din subah (lagbhag 10 baje) se ₹%2$s/month apne aap katenge, jab tak aap cancel na karein.</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_q3">Can I cancel anytime?</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_a3">Haan. Apne UPI app (jaise PhonePe, Google Pay, Paytm ya BHIM) ke Autopay / Mandates section mein jaakar MeraTune ka autopay kabhi bhi cancel kar sakte hain. Cancel karne ke baad aage koi autopay charge nahi katega. Madad ke liye Profile mein Help &amp; Support dekhein.</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_q4">Will I be charged immediately?</string>
    <string name="paywall_faq_a4">Haan, abhi sirf ₹%1$s katenge. Yeh ek baar ka trial charge hai aur wapas nahi hota. ₹%2$s ka pehla autopay agle din subah lagbhag 10 baje katega, phir har mahine. Usse pehle cancel karne par ₹%2$s nahi katenge.</string>
